                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I loved the original Resident Evil. Warts and all. So I really enjoyed this remaster.\r\nIf you enjoyed the original, then this game is for you. \r\nYes it has janky controls.\r\nYes it has cringe worthy dialogue.\r\nYes it has a glut of 5 second load screens that consist of doors opening.\r\nYes it has inventory managment up the wazoo.\r\n\r\nIf you have been too spoiled by modern games that hand you everything, steer clear of this one, because the only thing it will hand you is a challenge. The game is tough but fair.  Mostly fair. Somewhat fair. Fair except for that damned invisible enemies mode. (I'll crack it... just taking me a while)\r\n\r\nUnlike the other, more recent RE remakes, this one's got everything the orignal had and more!  New areas to explore, new enemies to fight, new survival mechanics, and a couple of new bosses.  This is the Granddaddy of survival horror and still holds up.",
